reak-even at ~100 NADO), so the rule taxed whoever did not think to split while the dilution it protected against arrives anyway. From the gate the open draw is every attested identity: one device one slot, capital-free, devbind still one identity per device, OPEN_BPS untouched; the dividend and the fidelity-gradient epoch are unchanged","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"freelensapp/freelens","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:20:30Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"c77470bb2dbb0af124432f8e5ea96bde8ec0ad05","github_link":"https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens/commit/c77470bb2dbb0af124432f8e5ea96bde8ec0ad05","commit_subject":"Default the CI agent to Opus 5 1M at high effort","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"PyAutoLabs/PyAutoFit","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:20:24Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"57d838c3862de4483ab9e09c801324ab2aff2487","github_link":"https://github.com/PyAutoLabs/PyAutoFit/commit/57d838c3862de4483ab9e09c801324ab2aff2487","commit_subject":"test(aggregator): cover grid searches under temporary extraction (#1584)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"dora-rs/dora","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:20:23Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"6776d26cfbef07ed70424cca51eec94a60ae2dbf","github_link":"https://github.com/dora-rs/dora/commit/6776d26cfbef07ed70424cca51eec94a60ae2dbf","commit_subject":"ci(docker): fix the multi-platform build and smoke the dora-slim image (#3470)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"sumatrapdfreader/sumatrapdf","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:20:12Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"4d0eda58d5756abecca72fc57f65e9bc2da84569","github_link":"https://github.com/sumatrapdfreader/sumatrapdf/commit/4d0eda58d5756abecca72fc57f65e9bc2da84569","commit_subject":"Let the app build the crash report text","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"dotnet/aspnetcore","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:20:07Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"1ec3d9bc67f19b205e9c546d0aa0c2e0e151960c","github_link":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/commit/1ec3d9bc67f19b205e9c5